PTX mbarrier-token-wait
"libcu++ cuda::barrier at block scope: each thread arrives (mbarrier.arrive, release.cta) and keeps the returned state, then waits with mbarrier.try_wait on that state, not on a parity (CCCL libcudacxx __barrier/barrier_block_scope.h:132-136, 200-204). The data written before the other thread's arrive must be visible after the wait. Expected: forbidden."
{
x=0 @cta 0;
b=mbarrier(2) @cta 0;
P0:r5=0;
P1:r6=0;
P1:r0=0;
P1:r1=0;
}
 P0@cta 0,cluster 0,gpu 0          | P1@cta 0,cluster 0,gpu 0                ;
 st.weak.shared::cta x, 1          | mbarrier.arrive.release.cta r6, b       ;
 mbarrier.arrive.release.cta r5, b | mbarrier.try_wait.acquire.cta r0, b, r6 ;
                                   | ld.weak.shared::cta r1, x               ;
exists
(P1:r0 == 1 /\ P1:r1 == 0)
